<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:27.490
CHAPTER 32

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:32.370
DEMON BELIAL
THE HUNDRED-YEAR GRUDGE

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:42.790
<i>Why must we be separated?</i>

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:46.590
<i>I should never have
fallen in love with you.</i>

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:49.510
<i>It was wrong for an </i>oni<i> to</i>
<i>fall in love with a human.</i>

00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:51.260
<i>It's not wrong!!</i>

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:55.260
<i>It's never wrong to fall in love!</i>

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:58.020
<i>Love has incredible power.</i>

00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:01.140
<i>As do you for being able to fall in love.</i>

00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:04.150
<i>My power of love?</i>

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:08.320
<i>Promise you'll protect me with that power.</i>

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:12.320
<i>Yeah. I swear I'll defeat the demons!!</i>

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:14.450
<i>With this power of love!</i>

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:17.080
The power of love...

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:20.500
It makes me feel an ache right here.

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:34.970
Just how long is it going to take to
find the Ring of--

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.060
What can't you find?

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:38.520
Mana.

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:41.350
Is it your destined true love?

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:43.480
Huh? No it's not.

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:44.730
Then what?

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:49.740
I'm sorry.

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:53.200
You don't have to say
if you don't want to.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:01.830
I know!

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:06.420
How about I take you somewhere cool!
It's a wonderful place!

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:08.840
It'll help take your mind off things.

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:10.960
But...

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:17.050
Let's go.

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:24.520
You say that, but all you really want
is a ride on my broom, don't you?

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:26.020
Could you tell?

00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:27.940
Honestly.

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:30.610
Hold on tight!

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:33.820
Go!

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:50.550
Shape up, Kojiro!

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:51.840
E-Elder!

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:55.630
How can you get distracted
during your important training?

00:04:55.970 --> 00:04:58.430
I swear I wasn't distracted!

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:05.140
Then, the Shingan Kaijoue skill
I ordered you to attain...

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:05.140
SHINGAN KAIJOUE

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:09.230
Show me the results of your training now!

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:12.820
Find which one is the real me.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.710
You're the real one!

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:34.720
Over here!

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:35.590
Ow!

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:40.100
It seems you haven't been fully
invested in your training

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:42.470
since this past summer.

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:45.230
Th-That's not...!

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:49.480
Lovesickness clouds the inner eye.

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:53.320
M-My inner eye isn't clouded at all!

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:57.610
Those words are for one
who has completed their training!

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:03.910
And over a human of all things.
Disgraceful.

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:09.040
It's my dad's hometown.

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:11.170
The ocean's so beautiful,

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:15.420
I'm sure you'll love
the town of Sakaiminato, Agnes!

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:17.420
I'm taking us down.

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:27.730
Isn't it amazing how beautiful it is?

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:36.740
M-Mana-san?!

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:41.200
Welcome, welcome.

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:45.580
Comics, weekly magazines, newspapers.
Anything you want.

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:49.750
I just got them
from the station trash can this morning.

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:54.340
A hundred years
since my power was sealed off.

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:58.470
No, it will be nearing 150 years soon.

00:06:58.590 --> 00:07:03.600
I never thought I'd be forced to live
such a wretched life...

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:07.060
Welco--

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:13.060
I never should have come to Japan...

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:16.900
What? You ran off?!

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:20.740
The elder scolded me.

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:22.530
What for?

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:23.780
Well...

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:25.240
Well...

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:26.870
Well...?

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:33.210
He said that a Karasu-Tengu and a human
can't be in love.

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:35.090
What? Love?!

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:40.010
Kojiro-san, you're in love?!
And with a human?!

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:43.140
What sort of person are you in love with?!

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:46.140
Huh?! Well, that's...

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:52.020
What are you talking about, Mana?
The person he's in love with is--

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:56.730
The ring's nearby?

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:59.530
Aww, I wanna know!

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:01.780
Something's come up.

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:02.740
Agnes?

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:06.450
Take care of Mana for me, knight-san.

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:12.120
Oh, she left...

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:16.960
M-Mana-san!

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:19.960
Yes?

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:22.470
Um, well...

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:27.640
Th-There's a place nearby
with a wonderful view.

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:29.520
Would you like to go with me?

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:31.980
While we wait for Agnes-san.

00:08:34.390 --> 00:08:37.060
What do you think Agnes is doing?

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:38.690
Are you concerned?

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:46.570
I was just wondering if she found anything
on where the Ring of Arcana will appear.

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:51.700
We have to stop
Backbeard's Brigadoon Project.

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:57.420
A message from Agnes?

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:02.260
The ring's in Sakaiminato?!

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:05.840
Wow! It's so pretty!

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:13.100
It's like all my stress about cram school
and taking tests is melting away.

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:18.360
I actually come here a lot
when I'm tired from training.

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:19.820
Oh really?

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:25.860
Yes. Whenever I have trouble learning
a skill or I feel uncertain.

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:27.450
Uncertain?

00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:31.490
I wonder if I can become a
good Karasu-Tengu like the elder.

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:33.620
Fog?

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:35.870
A cloud is covering the mountain.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.210
We can't see anymore.

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:39.790
Don't worry about it.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:40.630
Huh?

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:43.340
I'll blow this cloud away!

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:51.970
There!

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.220
The cloud's clearing!

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:58.100
This is nothing!
My power is greater than this!

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.550
What was that?

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:29.890
Did I just do something awful?

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:51.660
I'd forgotten this feeling for so long.

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:55.990
It appears my power is back.

00:10:56.830 --> 00:11:03.130
It seems the day that I've waited for
across long months and years is here.

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:07.510
It's time to satisfy this wrath
that seeps to the marrow of my bones!

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:15.010
DAISEN IN AUTUMN

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:19.520
DEMON BELIAL

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:18.520
<i>-"I sense </i>yokai<i> activity."</i>
<i>-"What'd I do?"</i>

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:19.520
<i>"I didn't see that..."</i>

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:22.810
Is Kojiro back?

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:25.360
No. He hasn't returned.

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:27.110
I see.

00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:31.990
Perhaps the age of
preaching from on high is over.

00:11:32.110 --> 00:11:34.200
Even for the Karasu-Tengu.

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.120
Kojiro?

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:40.500
You?!

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:42.580
We meet again at last.

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:43.790
Who are you?

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:47.550
This is the Western <i>yokai</i>, Belial.

00:11:48.210 --> 00:11:51.800
In the early Meiji period,
during the chaos of the Restoration,

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:58.350
he came to this island nation from
Portugal to claim everything for his own.

00:11:59.390 --> 00:12:03.400
He set castles ablaze...
caused great earthquakes...

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:07.230
and threw the people into terror.

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:10.820
Exactly!

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:16.830
But there was one who took advantage of a
moment's carelessness and sealed my power.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:26.250
It was that worthless old Karasu-Tengu!

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:29.840
I shall seal you in
the Orb of Yasakari once again!

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:33.220
I-I can't move...

00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:34.680
E-Elder-sama...

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:41.890
Now I shall satisfy
150 years' worth of my wrath.

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:17.890
I have a bad feeling.
Go to the foot of the mountain!

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:20.640
No, I'm coming with you!

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:35.740
Elder! Everyone!

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:41.200
Why did this happen to my village?

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:46.000
It's because you released my power.

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:51.920
Thanks to you, I was able to
have my revenge on that old fool.

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:54.670
You did this to the elder?!

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:56.680
You have my thanks.

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:05.430
Kojiro-san!

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:06.770
Get out of here!

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:20.450
Sealing that old fool away
with the rest of his village...

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:25.250
I was just beginning to regret it.

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:28.710
I should have tortured
and played with him some more.

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.380
Stop it!

00:14:32.170 --> 00:14:36.590
You're right. I grow bored of
the screams of a rural Tengu.

00:14:37.220 --> 00:14:38.590
Don't...

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:46.730
Now, in what sort of voice
will you scream for me?

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:48.980
Belial.

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:51.150
That voice...

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:03.120
It has been a long time, Backbeard-sama.

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:05.950
Hear me, Belial.

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:11.330
Kojiro-san!

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:13.540
Kojiro-san! Kojiro-san!

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:15.300
Are you all right?!

00:15:20.590 --> 00:15:23.550
I'm such a fool...

00:15:26.430 --> 00:15:29.520
Then, if I can find that Ring of Arcana

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:34.060
before that young witch
who is visiting this land does...

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:40.490
When my world comes to pass, you shall
have a seat fitting of your contribution.

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:45.450
I swear I, Belial,
shall fulfil your command, Backbeard-sama.

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:49.660
Where's the ring?!

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:59.300
I swear the Western <i>yokai</i>
position of high authority shall be mine!

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:00.670
Hair Needles!

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:04.640
Kitaro!

00:16:04.760 --> 00:16:06.050
Who are you?

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:12.440
By Backbeard-sama's command,
I, Belial, shall have the Ring of Arcana.

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:13.730
What?

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:17.650
A-whoosh!

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:20.860
I'll handle him! You find the ring!

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:22.280
All right!

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:23.990
Oh no you don't!

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:28.700
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:42.470
After an eternity of suffering,
I finally have my chance to thrive anew.

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:45.550
I'm not about to let it go!

00:16:49.390 --> 00:16:50.720
What is that?!

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:03.490
I'm a fool...

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:08.620
I don't focus on my training,
I fail at my technique...

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:11.040
I let that thing loose...

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:14.250
And I lost the elder and the others!

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:16.540
The elder was right.

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:22.170
A whelp like me
losing focus over love was wrong.

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:24.130
It's not wrong!

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:29.140
It's never wrong to fall in love!

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:33.140
On the contrary,
love has incredible power.

00:17:33.430 --> 00:17:36.100
As do you for being able to fall in love,
Kojiro-san.

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:37.650
Me?

00:17:37.940 --> 00:17:39.440
I have the power of love?

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:43.280
It's not love or Kojiro-san that's wrong.

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:45.110
It's that <i>yokai</i>!

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:47.070
Then, I...

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:49.660
I can be in love?!

00:17:50.120 --> 00:17:51.030
Yeah!

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:57.620
You're right.

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:01.460
This isn't the time for
wallowing in self-pity.

00:18:01.590 --> 00:18:06.380
If I defeat him, it might restore
the elder and the others.

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:08.760
I swear I'm going to win!

00:18:09.430 --> 00:18:11.760
With this power of love!

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:16.350
Whoops!

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:18.480
Chanchanko!

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:20.310
Hair Needles!

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:24.070
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:31.160
It's not working?!

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:35.580
Pee-yoo!

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:40.830
I'm comin' to help ya!

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:42.210
Or not!

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:47.170
Aim for his weak spot, Kitaro!

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:48.590
His weak spot?

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:52.470
His heart must be somewhere among these.

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:54.470
But how can I...?!

00:18:54.930 --> 00:18:56.600
I'll find it for you!

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:00.100
Kojiro-san.

00:19:09.490 --> 00:19:11.530
Shingan Kaijoue!

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:29.760
I've found it!

00:19:49.900 --> 00:19:51.240
Finger Guns!

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:03.830
I found it!

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:08.710
Wait! Wait!

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:09.720
Wait!

00:20:15.010 --> 00:20:16.760
No!

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.640
But...

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:27.610
We defeated him,
but the village hasn't been restored...

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:35.120
<i>Feka to nawo</i>

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:37.700
<i>Inoka iga</i>

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:41.290
<i>Feka to nawo</i>

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:42.960
<i>Inoka iga</i>

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:07.360
She restored the entire village.
What amazing power!

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:10.530
It's thanks for helping.

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:13.530
Kojiro.

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:15.490
Thank you.

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:17.070
Well done!

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:19.870
Elder! Everyone!

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:24.210
I see. So your inner eye has opened.

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:28.380
Very well.
I shall accept your power of love.

00:21:28.750 --> 00:21:29.670
Elder!

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:31.130
Kojiro-san!

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:33.090
Mana-san!

00:21:36.010 --> 00:21:37.890
I'm rooting for you!

00:21:38.010 --> 00:21:40.760
I'm sure your love
will work out, Kojiro-san!

00:21:40.890 --> 00:21:41.600
Huh?!

00:21:44.140 --> 00:21:45.230
"My"...?

00:21:53.650 --> 00:21:54.820
What's wrong?

00:21:57.320 --> 00:21:59.070
Good grief.

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.500
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.500
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.340
<i>"Hello" in the mountains</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.340
<i>yama de yahho</i>

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:17.260
<i>If you call</i>

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:17.260
<i>hitokoe yobeba</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.550
<i>An identical "Hello"</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.550
<i>onaji yahho</i>

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:24.850
<i>The Yobuko calls back</i>

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:24.850
<i>yobuko ga kaesu</i>

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.440
<i>A tree spirit living in the mountains</i>

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.440
<i>yama ni sunderu ki no seirei</i>

00:22:30.650 --> 00:22:32.860
<i>A used rag</i>

00:22:30.650 --> 00:22:32.860
<i>tsukatta zoukin</i>

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:35.740
<i>If you don't keep it clean</i>

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:35.740
<i>kirei ni shinaito</i>

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>It'll get smelly</i>

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>kusaku nattayo</i>

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:43.490
<i>The Shiro-Uneri
Will tangle itself around you</i>

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:43.490
<i>shirouneri karamitsuku</i>

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.040
<i>Stuck to your face
How horrible</i>

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.040
<i>kao ni bettori korya tamaran</i>

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>See how many ghosts there are</i>

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>konnani oruyo obaketachi</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.090
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.090
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:59.010
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:59.010
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:03.430
<i>They're near you</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:03.430
<i>kimi no chikaku ni</i>

00:23:06.350 --> 00:23:09.980
<i>Dad, a letter says someone wants
their daughter protected from the Yoko...</i>

00:23:10.310 --> 00:23:12.400
<i>But something's strange.</i>

00:23:12.520 --> 00:23:14.900
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:15.190 --> 00:23:17.440
<i>"The Fox's Wedding and Hakusanbo"</i>

00:23:17.570 --> 00:23:19.910
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
